flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read a and b/]
    B --> C[Make a and b positive]
    C --> D{a = 0 and b = 0?}
    D -->|Yes| E[/Print HCF is undefined/]
    E --> Z([Stop])
    D -->|No| F{b ≠ 0?}
    F -->|Yes| G[r ← a mod b]
    G --> H[a ← b]
    H --> I[b ← r]
    I --> F
    F -->|No| J[/Print a as HCF/]
    J --> Z
